{
  "name": "GD·08 CRM · Upsert lead",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·08 CRM · Upsert lead (Boss 5 · D6b, from 5.9)\nONE sub-workflow every engine calls when a business lead appears (outreach reply, Instagram/Facebook comment, WhatsApp, email).\nInput: lead_id, customer_id, name, email, phone, company, domain, business_type, lead_source, consent, intent, delivery_zone, asked_price_or_tasting, email_opens, staff.\n1 normalise (email lowercase, phone +234…, domain without www) and SCORE in code\n2 company: CRM ID already saved? → else search by domain → update : create\n3 contact: create or update BY EMAIL (or saved ID / create when no email)\n4 associate contact ↔ company\n5 crossed the call-first threshold → lifecycle Sales qualified lead + \"Call today\" task + Telegram ping\n6 buying intent and no open deal for this company → deal at New enquiry, owner Tolu, associated to both\n7 CRM IDs saved in Supabase (customers + leads). It never changes a deal stage.\n\n**Credentials:** HubSpot App Token (private app), Postgres, Telegram.\n**Replace:** YOUR_HUBSPOT_OWNER_ID (Tolu), YOUR_STAGE_NEW_ENQUIRY, YOUR_PIPELINE_ID, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "a671d3f0-c21e-49df-a056-96413dfc9097",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -468
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "991d708e-7a9b-4a0a-8e1a-149733ec2e4d",
      "name": "Called by an engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 1. Normalise keys, then score (weights calibrated in the 5.9 Card 3 lab).\nconst W = { type: 20, asked: 25, opens: 5, size: 10 };\nconst L = { ...$json };\nconst free = ['gmail.com', 'yahoo.com', 'hotmail.com', 'outlook.com', 'icloud.com', 'ymail.com'];\nL.email = L.email ? String(L.email).trim().toLowerCase() : '';\nif (L.phone) { const d = String(L.phone).replace(/\\D/g, '').replace(/^(234|0)/, ''); L.phone = d.length === 10 ? '+234' + d : ''; }\nL.domain = String(L.domain || '').toLowerCase().replace(/^https?:\\/\\//, '').replace(/^www\\./, '').split('/')[0];\nif (!L.domain && L.email && !free.includes(L.email.split('@')[1])) L.domain = L.email.split('@')[1];\nL.company = String(L.company || '').trim();\nconst [first, ...rest] = String(L.name || '').trim().split(/\\s+/);\nL.firstname = first || ''; L.lastname = rest.join(' ');\nlet s = 0, ready = false, why = '';\nif (L.delivery_zone !== 'in') { why = 'outside delivery zone'; }\nelse {\n  s = 30;\n  if (['restaurant', 'hotel', 'caterer'].includes(L.business_type)) s += W.type;\n  if (L.asked_price_or_tasting) s += W.asked;\n  if (Number(L.email_opens) >= 3) s += W.opens;\n  if (Number(L.staff) >= 20) s += W.size;\n  ready = s >= 65;\n}\nreturn { json: { ...L, harvest_score: s, ready, why } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "ca818a53-f88e-4ff0-bd92-3c2ecadad556",
      "name": "Normalise and score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT coalesce(c.crm_company_id, l.crm_company_id) AS crm_company_id,\n       coalesce(c.crm_contact_id, l.crm_contact_id) AS crm_contact_id,\n       coalesce(c.harvest_score, l.harvest_score, 0) AS previous_score\nFROM (SELECT 1) x\nLEFT JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = nullif($1, '')\nLEFT JOIN leads l ON l.lead_id::text = nullif($2, '');",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.customer_id ?? '', String($json.lead_id ?? '') ] }}"
        }
      },
